{"pages":[{"ocr":false,"h":792,"segs":[["get over yourself",117.0111,60.377600000000029,495.00410000000005,148.0806,77,false],["We get together, look at a book or passage of the",52.840000000000003,442.1302,308.9049,458.79509999999999,13.300000000000001,false],["New Testament, then try to hash it out— make",52.840000000000003,465.1259,296.11029999999994,481.79079999999999,13.300000000000001,false],["sense of what it all means. We discuss, debate,",52.840000000000003,488.1216,292.1735000000001,504.78649999999999,13.300000000000001,false],["agree, disagree: but always find a way to apply it",52.840000000000003,511.1173,299.74120000000011,527.78219999999999,13.300000000000001,false],["personally. No requirements, but no cynics: we’re",52.840000000000003,534.11299999999994,306.6173,550.77789999999993,13.300000000000001,false],["serious about pursuing a stronger more authentic",52.840000000000003,557.1087,311.2989,573.77359999999999,13.300000000000001,false],["faith—and you’re invited.",52.840000000000003,580.10439999999994,182.3554,596.76929999999993,13.300000000000001,false]],"w":612}]}